    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "And here we see (as we see partly also among the whales), that these three series of processes, or struts, tend to be arranged well-nigh at equal angles, of 120°, with one another, giving the greatest and most uniform strength of which such a system is capable." ;
